<h1>About</h1>
<h2><b>ConnectedCity™</b> helps local marketplaces thrive in the digital world.</h2>

<h3>Our Vision: Sustainable local communities.</h3>
<p><b>ConnectedCity™</b> empowers local businesses to reach and communicate 
with shoppers to drive local spending and achieve sustainable 
economic growth.</p>

<h3>Our Mission: Buy local.</h3>
<p><b>ConnectedCity™</b> is more than just a philosophy it is a practical tool for keeping money circulating in your local economy.</p>


<h1>Shoppers</h1>
<h2><b>ConnectedCity™</b> saves shoppers time searching for local shopping opportunities.</h2>
<p>ConnectedShopper™ is a shopping management application that helps you personalize your shopping experience to stay informed about local opportunities in real-time.</p>
<p>
	Features and benefits include:

	<ul>
		<li>Organize and manage your favorite businesses and their real-time updates</li>
		<li>Find merchants that sell your favorite brands</li>
		<li>Claim deals and coupons</li>
		<li>Earn loyalty rewards</li>
		<li>Share shopping opportunities with friends</li>
		<li>Share recommendations with friends</li>
		<li>Win free stuff</li>
		<li>And more!</li>
	</ul>
</p>

<h1>Businesses</h1>

<h2><b>ConnectedCity™</b> saves businesses time and money promoting their brands, 
products and services locally.</h2>

